What was changed in nao's Apache-licensed files
-----------------------------------------------
- Product name and logos: "nao" replaced by "Insight" in user-visible text, and the logo,
  favicon and icon artwork replaced (file names kept so imports still resolve).
- No licence key: every feature is on; INSIGHT_DISABLED_FEATURES switches features off.
- No contact with nao Labs: the licence-server ping, the PyPI update check and the default
  telemetry key are disabled.
- apps/backend/src/app.ts: nao Cloud's internal backoffice API is not registered.
- apps/backend/src/queries/account.queries.ts: refresh-token queries for Microsoft sign-in.
- apps/frontend: "Upgrade to Enterprise" badges read "Off"; the Enterprise page is "Features".
- cli: package renamed insight-core with an `insight` command, version 1.0.0.
- Tests: expectations updated for the product name; nao's licence-key test replaced.
- Database connections managed from the web app: Oracle and SQLite engines, insight_connections.yaml
  merged by the config loader, test/sync/context-path endpoints in the query service, a
  database_connection table, and the Settings > Project > Databases page.
- Dependencies installed against cli/uv.lock (sqlglot pinned below 30.1).
